{"id":"824fdc45d800b7dd","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-robinson-arithmetic.md","title":"Robinson Arithmetic","display":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-robinson-arithmetic","aliases":["67-df-robinson-arithmetic"],"display":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[67-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-formula]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-robinson-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-robinson-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97e929795d778cd6\" href=\"?note=97e929795d778cd6\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-language\">67-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\">\\(L_A\\)</span>、数词与派生连接词取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97e929795d778cd6\" href=\"?note=97e929795d778cd6\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-language\">67-df-arithmetic-language</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=v_0,y=v_1\">\\(x=v_0,y=v_1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 是有限公理集而不是演绎闭包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Q\">\\(\\mathsf Q\\)</span> 是同一公理集的别名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nQ\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\\forall x\\neg(Sx=0),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y(Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x(x\\ne0\\to\\exists y(x=Sy)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x(x+0=x),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y(x+Sy=S(x+y)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x(x\\times0=0),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y(x\\times Sy=(x\\times y)+x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf Q&amp;\\coloneqq Q.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nQ\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\\forall x\\neg(Sx=0),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y(Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x(x\\ne0\\to\\exists y(x=Sy)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x(x+0=x),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y(x+Sy=S(x+y)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x(x\\times0=0),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y(x\\times Sy=(x\\times y)+x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf Q&amp;\\coloneqq Q.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条只给出后续条目实际使用的接口；所有数学条件均已列入前两节。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"97e929795d778cd6","anchor